    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d494">

                <pb facs="0503" n="1237" sameAs="frus:frus1895p2/pg1237"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Terrell to Mr. Gresham</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Pera</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1895-02-23"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">February 23,
                    1895</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>On information from British ambassador that Americans at Bitlis fear attack, I
                    demanded at Porte telegraphic order for protection, which was promptly sent.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Terrell.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
